	(text "Four isolated CAN FD channels (ISO1044BD). Logic side +3V3/GND, bus side V5_BUS/GND_BUS (12 V domain).\nConnector pinout as every ThlHats board: 1 CANH, 2 CANL, 3 GND_BUS, 4 +12 V (cable supply).\nCAN1 = can-ssr bus: F10 fitted. CAN2-4 = DUT buses: F11-F13 DNP, so pin 4 is dead unless fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
